{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cold Response</strong> puts you in the seat of a drone operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll deploy and pilot custom built FPV drones in a near-future Scandinavian military conflict as the last line of defense. Strategize, improvise, and strike back against invading forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the environment reacts: seasons shift, days turn into nights, and structures collapse under fire. Every flight is a test. Every crash is a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.poster.avif?t=1758187678\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.webm?t=1758187678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.mp4?t=1758187678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take to the Skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot freely across a small, isolated, Swedish village. Hone your flight techniques, crash through buildings, enemies and test weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod your drone builds endlessly. Equip them with absurd weapons, from shotguns and grenades to recoilless rifles like the traditional Swedish Pansarskott M/86.<br><br>The only answer to violence is\u00a0<i>more</i> violence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/424d1617467cb0dd39791d16095719db.poster.avif?t=1758187678\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/424d1617467cb0dd39791d16095719db.webm?t=1758187678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/424d1617467cb0dd39791d16095719db.mp4?t=1758187678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hold the Line</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, scavenge for spare parts, and launch specialized drones to hold off incoming enemy forces. Every drone lost is a setback. Every decision matters. You'll command kamikaze drones, recon units, and heavy assault models, each with customizable load-outs and real-time feedback. Build your strategy. Hold the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/7d5b5cb6f4f839f0f1f186fbb586f65b.poster.avif?t=1758187678\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/7d5b5cb6f4f839f0f1f186fbb586f65b.webm?t=1758187678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/7d5b5cb6f4f839f0f1f186fbb586f65b.mp4?t=1758187678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic (Combat) Drone Simulation with Sandbox Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compose drones, upgrades, weapons and parts to create the right tool for the right job</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the homeland from the scourge in a highly destructible world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A never ending struggle against enemies, weather seasons, fauna, gravity, you personally and time itself to try and stay alive</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831420?t=1758187678","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/03666f0244c98f49649fb1c79f151f33c3292dcb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758187678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/fde10654703ca146ab61aba994780ee6e694ff32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758187678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/fde10654703ca146ab61aba994780ee6e694ff32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758187678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You kill people with exploding drones."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cold Response</strong> puts you in the seat of a drone operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll deploy and pilot custom built FPV drones in a near-future Scandinavian military conflict as the last line of defense. Strategize, improvise, and strike back against invading forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the environment reacts: seasons shift, days turn into nights, and structures collapse under fire. Every flight is a test. Every crash is a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.poster.avif?t=1758187678\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.webm?t=1758187678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sh